{
  "class": "ExplosionPacket",
  "module": "server/play/explosion_packet",
  "module_docs": [
    "Port of `net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.ExplosionPacket`.",
    "",
    "# Deferrals",
    "",
    "**None** for the particles: both go out through the ported",
    "`crate::particle::network_type()` \u2014 `Particle.NETWORK_TYPE`, the var-int id",
    "*and* the variant's `writeData`. A `Particle.Block` therefore carries its",
    "block state id, which `probes/expected/particlewireprobe.json` pins.",
    "",
    "- `SoundEvent.NETWORK_TYPE` is reused from",
    "  [`EntitySoundEffectPacket`](super::entity_sound_effect_packet), which",
    "  declares the same local type for the same Java constant. Java's field is",
    "  not `@Nullable`, so a `None` sound is rejected rather than invented."
  ],
  "struct": {
    "docs": [
      "Java: `record ExplosionPacket(Point center, float radius, int blockCount,",
      "Point playerKnockback, Particle particle, SoundEvent sound, WeightedList<BlockParticleInfo>",
      "blockParticles, boolean playSound)`."
    ],
    "derives": [
      "Clone",
      "Debug",
      "PartialEq"
    ],
    "form": "braced"
  },
  "fields": [
    {
